    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Doodle Drive \u2013 Where Creativity Meets Physics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Doodle Drive</strong>, every level is a canvas, and your imagination is the key to success! Use your creativity to draw roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car through a series of challenging puzzles. Navigate tricky terrain, collect stars, and drive your way to victory in this fun, physics-based adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draw Mode:</strong>\u00a0Use your ink to create roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive Mode:</strong>\u00a0Test your creations by driving the car along your path and collecting stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.poster.avif?t=1746878855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.webm?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.mp4?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draw Your Own Path</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sketch custom roads and physics shapes to create the perfect route for your car to navigate each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 Unique Cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 9 different cars, each with its own driving style and abilities. Pick the right one for each challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>36 Handcrafted Levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of meticulously designed levels that will put your creativity and problem-solving skills to the test.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Physics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience realistic physics as your car and doodles interact with the environment, making every run feel unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Creativity</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles in your own way \u2013 no two solutions are ever the same. The more inventive you are, the better your chances of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/3d3c5e9bb672253a3a605cd390837b90.avif?t=1746878855\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Draw smart. Drive fast. Expect a few flips along the way.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Doodle Drive \u2013 Where Creativity Meets Physics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Doodle Drive</strong>, every level is a canvas, and your imagination is the key to success! Use your creativity to draw roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car through a series of challenging puzzles. Navigate tricky terrain, collect stars, and drive your way to victory in this fun, physics-based adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draw Mode:</strong>\u00a0Use your ink to create roads, ramps, and shapes to guide your car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drive Mode:</strong>\u00a0Test your creations by driving the car along your path and collecting stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.poster.avif?t=1746878855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.webm?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/1174a3402b584ae850c5a311537bea7f.mp4?t=1746878855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draw Your Own Path</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sketch custom roads and physics shapes to create the perfect route for your car to navigate each level.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 Unique Cars</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 9 different cars, each with its own driving style and abilities. Pick the right one for each challenge!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>36 Handcrafted Levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of meticulously designed levels that will put your creativity and problem-solving skills to the test.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Physics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience realistic physics as your car and doodles interact with the environment, making every run feel unique.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Creativity</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles in your own way \u2013 no two solutions are ever the same. The more inventive you are, the better your chances of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011190/extras/3d3c5e9bb672253a3a605cd390837b90.avif?t=1746878855\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Draw smart. Drive fast. Expect a few flips along the way.</strong></h2>",
